  "body": "What happens: on main `d94b981`, the xtask unit test `icons_tests::committed_icon_pngs_match_their_svg_masters` fails:\n\n```\nicon PNGs out of step - run `cargo xtask icons`:\ntool-form-mill.png: differs from its master by 44 - run `cargo xtask icons`\n```\n\nEvidence: it fails on Windows (the bacon quick check of main `ddee3ae..d94b981`) and on macOS (`cargo test -p xtask --bin xtask icons_tests::committed_icon_pngs_match_their_svg_masters` on `d94b981`). The icon came in with #3946 (`9de610ac4`, form mill kind). The Linux post-merge gate did not run the xtask unit suite for that merge, so main showed green.\n\nExpected: the committed PNG is the render of its SVG master.\n\nDone means: `cargo xtask icons` output is committed for `tool-form-mill.png`, and the test passes.\n",
